<title>CHAD: Chad interior minister sacked.</title>
<headline>Chad interior minister sacked.</headline>
<dateline>N'DJAMENA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chad's President Idriss Deby sacked his interior and security minister Youssouf Togoimi on Monday, sources at the presidency said.</p>
<p>No official reason was given for the removal of Togoimi, a northerner like Deby and up until now regarded as one of the president's loyalists.</p>
<p>The sources said a presidential decree formalising the dismissal also named Togoimi's replacement as Abdraman Sallah, a close political associate of Deby.</p>
</text>
